---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Check your inbox | Pranjal Pandey" description="Confirm your email, then choose the free AI Strategy Starter, Personal AI Starter Kit, or both." minimal noindex>
  <div class="wrap"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">One more step</p><h1>Almost there.<br />Check your inbox.</h1><p class="lead">If you just signed up, look for an email from Pranjal Pandey. Click the confirmation button to confirm and get your free guides.</p></header>
    <div class="reading"><p>On the next page you pick what you want: the guide for your business, the kit for yourself, or both. Both are free.</p><p>Check promotions or spam if the email is hiding. Already subscribed and no new email? <a href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Existing%20subscriber%20guide%20access`}>Email me for help getting your guides</a>.</p><p>Need help? <a href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Help%20with%20the%20free%20guides`}>Email {site.email}</a>, or <a href="/guide/">return to the guide form</a>.</p><h2>While you wait</h2><ul><li>Leading a team or company? <a href="/call/">Book a free 30-minute intro call</a>.</li><li>Building a career in AI? <a href="/career/">Book a career session</a>.</li></ul></div>
  </div>
</Layout>
